        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "148. Regular full-time non-probationary employees, who work on a holiday specified in Section 1 above shall be paid at the overtime rate of time and one-half (1-1/2) and shall also be given a paid day off or additional-pay of eight (8) hours for such holiday. The determination of the options shall be in accordance with Section 9 below.",
